;SHEET
BETA SHEET RA FROM SUBUNIT A ALIGNS WITH BETA SHEET RB
OF SUBUNIT B TO FORM AN 8 STRAND SHEET.
STRAND R-4 OF ONE SUBUNIT CONTACTS STRAND R-4 OF THE OTHER.
REGISTER: ASN 368 O - LEU 370 N, ASN 368 N - LEU 370 O.
;
